        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Hail Flower Dragon.</em></p><p>Make a Strike with your spirit weapon. On a hit it deals an additional @Damage[1d6[cold]] damage, and the target must succeed at a Fortitude save or be <strong>immobilized</strong> in ice until the end of its next turn (Escape against your Reiatsu DC).</p><p>On a <strong>critical hit</strong> the ice shatters: the target instead takes an additional 2d6 cold and is <strong>off-guard</strong> until the end of its next turn.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p><p><strong>Refined (9th) &mdash; Guncho Tsurara</strong> <em>(Icicle Volley)</em>. Ry&#363;senka may instead be made as a <strong>ranged</strong> Strike against a target within 60 feet, hurling the blade on its chain; it returns to your hand immediately.</p>"
